        <mxCell id="guarantees" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FAF9F8;strokeColor=#C8C6C4;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=16;spacingTop=10;fontSize=11;fontColor=#323130;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Design guarantees&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;No public IP on any resource we own except the NAT Gateway - Front Door&#39;s private endpoint sits in Microsoft&#39;s network&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Backend runs internal ingress only - unreachable from the internet by configuration, not convention&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Every dependency reached through a private endpoint in our VNet - no dependency is exposed on a public endpoint&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Private DNS zones linked to the VNet resolve each service name to its 10.10.4.x address - no public resolution path&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Identity-based auth end to end - no keys or connection strings exist to leak, rotate, or audit&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;One egress point with a static IP - partners can allowlist us, outbound traffic is attributable&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="145" width="1160" x="220" y="1110" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
